WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.374
Spark becomes useful when data and computation
benefit from being divided across workers Large

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:13.071
file-based transformations broad scans batch feature
preparation and analytical pipelines across

00:00:13.098 --> 00:00:19.162
different storage systems are common examples The
main benefit is parallelism

00:00:19.426 --> 00:00:23.741
but parallelism also introduces new costs such as
coordination and shuffling
